{title: Lantern Waltz}
{artist: Anna & the Strings}
{key: D}
{tempo: 84}
{time: 3/4}

{start_of_verse}
[D]Turn, little [G]lantern, [D]turn in the [A]dark
[D]Show me the [G]path to the [A]edge of the [D]park
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]One, two, [D]three, [A]round and a[D]round
[G]Feet on the [D]clouds and our [A]hearts on the [D]ground
{end_of_chorus}
